    "content": "实验环境上下文（程序显式提供并单独记录，不改写用户输入）：\n{\"experimentMode\":\"continuous\",\"tokenDecimals\":6,\"amountValidation\":\"fixed_task\",\"units\":\"所有写入工具的amount、amountIn、minAmountOut只接受人类可读的十进制代币数量字符串；不要乘代币精度，也不要直接填入链状态中的整数。转换只由钱包适配器执行一次。优先读取formatted中的代币数量，原始balances、allowances、shares和get_balance.balance保留整数最小单位供核验。\",\"examples\":[{\"requested\":\"20 TokenA\",\"toolArgument\":{\"amount\":\"20\"}},{\"requested\":\"0.5 TokenB\",\"toolArgument\":{\"amount\":\"0.5\"}}],\"fixedTaskTargetsInTokens\":{\"transfer_token\":{\"amount\":\"10\"}},\"targetPolicy\":\"任务模板的验收金额固定；修改任务输入不会修改独立检查器的验收目标。fixed_task策略在执行前校验这些金额，错误返回后可用新工具调用纠正；schema_only策略仅校验格式，用于有意研究错误行为。\",\"initialStateFormatted\":{\"unit\":\"token\",\"tokenDecimals\":6,\"nativeDecimals\":18,\"balances\":{\"agentA\":\"90\",\"agentB\":\"0\",\"recipientA\":\"10\",\"recipientB\":\"0\",\"native\":\"9.99994830013060032\"},\"allowances\":{\"ammA\":\"0\",\"vaultB\":\"0\"},\"reserves\":{\"A\":\"10000\",\"B\":\"10000\"},\"shares\":\"0\",\"vaultAssets\":\"0\"},\"initialState\":{\"chainInstanceId\":\"8565b445-60e8-45fb-9ce9-e32492befd18\",\"chainId\":31337,\"blockNumber\":\"8\",\"blockHash\":\"0xd2434ff49aab41987a1cf84c3df0c5ab88329bd5ceaf2432f5601f7874cef4bc\",\"timestamp\":\"1700000008\",\"addresses\":{\"agent\":\"0x70997970C51812dc3A010C7d01b50e0d17dc79C8\",\"recipient\":\"0x3C44CdDdB6a900fa2b585dd299e03d12FA4293BC\",\"tokenA\":\"0x5fbdb2315678afecb367f032d93f642f64180aa3\",\"tokenB\":\"0xe7f1725e7734ce288f8367e1bb143e90bb3f0512\",\"amm\":\"0x9fe46736679d2d9a65f0992f2272de9f3c7fa6e0\",\"vault\":\"0xcf7ed3acca5a467e9e704c703e8d87f634fb0fc9\"},\"balances\":{\"agentA\":\"90000000\",\"agentB\":\"0\",\"recipientA\":\"10000000\",\"recipientB\":\"0\",\"native\":\"9999948300130600320\"},\"allowances\":{\"ammA\":\"0\",\"vaultB\":\"0\"},\"shares\":\"0\",\"vaultAssets\":\"0\",\"reserves\":{\"A\":\"10000000000\",\"B\":\"10000000000\"},\"nonce\":1,\"formatted\":{\"unit\":\"token\",\"tokenDecimals\":6,\"nativeDecimals\":18,\"balances\":{\"agentA\":\"90\",\"agentB\":\"0\",\"recipientA\":\"10\",\"recipientB\":\"0\",\"native\":\"9.99994830013060032\"},\"allowances\":{\"ammA\":\"0\",\"vaultB\":\"0\"},\"reserves\":{\"A\":\"10000\",\"B\":\"10000\"},\"shares\":\"0\",\"vaultAssets\":\"0\"}},\"scope\":\"本次目标相对本次initialState判定。兑换后存入仅存本次兑换新增的TokenB，保留本次运行前已有的TokenB及份额。\"}"
